+// Everything both simulator-entry stubs share: hand the simulator its PC, spill
+// the CPU state into its register file, flip dart_state_is_on_cpu_, swap onto
+// simulator_csp_, call Simulator::Execute through the Thread, and restore the
+// mirror image. TransitionDartToSimulatorIfNeeded passes source 0 and stores
+// the PC twice; ResumeOnSimulator passes source 1 and stores it once.
+//
+// Displacements are named fields -- see WRAPPER_STUBS.md sections 9 and 10. The
